00:00:00.659 --> 00:00:04.810
Hello and welcome to this video on the
purpose of a visual management systems.

00:00:05.590 --> 00:00:10.170
In this video, we will explore how visual
management can improve communication,

00:00:10.690 --> 00:00:15.620
streamline workflows, and enhance
overall efficiency in the workplace.

00:00:17.480 --> 00:00:19.189
So what is visual management?

00:00:19.950 --> 00:00:25.900
Visual management is a system that utilises
visual cues and aids to convey information,

00:00:26.360 --> 00:00:29.370
guide actions, and improve understanding.

00:00:30.125 --> 00:00:36.385
It involves the use of charts, diagrams,
signs, colour coding, and other visual

00:00:36.405 --> 00:00:38.995
elements to create a visual workplace.

00:00:40.815 --> 00:00:45.635
Visual management promotes clear
communication by providing visual cues that

00:00:45.635 --> 00:00:48.025
are easily understandable and accessible.

00:00:48.785 --> 00:00:53.754
Visual aids eliminate the need for lengthy
written instructions and help convey

00:00:53.754 --> 00:00:55.915
information quickly and effectively.

00:00:56.665 --> 00:01:01.695
For example, let's consider a warehouse
where inventory management is vital.

00:01:02.235 --> 00:01:08.415
By implementing a visual management system, such
as a color coded labeling system, each product

00:01:08.455 --> 00:01:10.815
category can be assigned a specific color.

00:01:11.335 --> 00:01:16.625
This visual cue allows employees to
quickly identify and locate items, reducing

00:01:16.625 --> 00:01:19.145
search time, and minimising errors.

00:01:20.994 --> 00:01:26.375
By visually representing standard operating
procedures, visual management supports

00:01:26.385 --> 00:01:29.074
process standardisation and consistency.

00:01:30.625 --> 00:01:35.954
It helps ensure that tasks are performed
in a uniform manner, reducing errors,

00:01:36.284 --> 00:01:43.144
improving quality, and enabling continuous
improvement, enhanced productivity.

00:01:44.010 --> 00:01:49.640
By using visual cues, employees can
quickly grasp information, make informed

00:01:49.640 --> 00:01:52.910
decisions, and perform tasks efficiently.

00:01:53.640 --> 00:02:00.419
Visual management eliminates confusion, reduces
errors, and increases overall productivity.

00:02:02.240 --> 00:02:03.300
Improved safety.

00:02:04.014 --> 00:02:08.875
Visual management plays a crucial role
in promoting safety in the workplace.

00:02:09.655 --> 00:02:16.435
Clear signage, warning labels, and visual
reminders help employees identify potential

00:02:16.444 --> 00:02:21.675
hazards, follow safety protocols, and
maintain a safe working environment.

00:02:23.545 --> 00:02:24.674
Performance tracking.

00:02:25.435 --> 00:02:30.695
Visual management provides a visual representation
of key performance indicators and metrics.

00:02:31.480 --> 00:02:37.370
This allows teams to track performance,
identify areas for improvement, and

00:02:37.370 --> 00:02:39.680
drive continuous improvement efforts.

00:02:41.550 --> 00:02:42.879
Employee engagement.

00:02:43.629 --> 00:02:48.649
By providing a visual representation
of performance metrics, progress, and

00:02:48.649 --> 00:02:55.279
achievements, visual management systems promote
transparency and encourage employee engagement.

00:02:55.845 --> 00:03:01.964
This can lead to increased motivation,
accountability, and a sense of ownership.

00:03:03.834 --> 00:03:05.245
Continuous improvement.

00:03:06.505 --> 00:03:11.664
Visual management supports a culture of
continuous improvement by facilitating the

00:03:11.665 --> 00:03:14.424
identification of improvement opportunities.

00:03:15.000 --> 00:03:21.980
Visual displays of key performance
indicators, KPIs, and metrics help teams

00:03:21.980 --> 00:03:28.219
identify areas for optimisation, track
progress, and drive performance improvement.

00:03:29.009 --> 00:03:34.099
So as you can see, the purpose of a visual
management system is to create a visually

00:03:34.099 --> 00:03:38.830
organised, efficient, and productive
work environment where information

00:03:38.830 --> 00:03:44.560
is readily available, processes are
standardised, and communication is enhanced.

00:03:45.170 --> 00:03:51.209
It helps teams work cohesively, improve decision
making, and achieve their goals effectively.

